WEBVTT

q0001
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.378
How can one machine operation evaluate many assignments at the same time?

q0002
00:00:07.378 --> 00:00:18.071
This episode has one job: Bigint and word-packed evaluators carry the same ordered truth vector in different exact storage/execution layouts; selector performance belongs to a later episode.

q0003
00:00:18.071 --> 00:00:28.764
We build on Live support versus ambient variables, Explicit dense CM versus CM-IR; their definitions stay fixed while this lesson adds a new layer.

q0004
00:00:28.764 --> 00:00:37.283
