q0062
00:09:13.940 --> 00:09:21.889
Packed storage changes how outputs travel through the machine, not what outputs mean.

q0063
00:09:21.889 --> 00:09:31.549
A common mistake is this: Packed words, CSE-flat, and a dense correspondence matrix are interchangeable representations.

q0064
